  "result": "Excellent! All 53 tests pass. I've added two new line-management functions to `src/invoices.js`:\n\n**`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`** \u2014 Adds a line to a draft invoice or increases qty if the SKU already exists. Validates qty and SKU the same way `createInvoice` does. Returns `fail(NOT_DRAFT)` if the invoice isn't in 'draft' status.\n\n**`removeLine(invoice, sku)`** \u2014 Removes a line from a draft invoice. Returns:\n- `fail(NOT_DRAFT)` if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n- `fail(LINE_NOT_FOUND)` if the SKU isn't on the invoice\n- `fail(NO_LINES)` if it's the last line (invoices must have at least one)\n\nBoth functions never mutate the input invoice and return new objects with updated lines.\n\nAdded error codes: `LINE_NOT_FOUND` and `NOT_DRAFT`.\n\nAdded 13 comprehensive tests covering adding new/existing lines, removing lines (including middle and last), chaining operations, immutability, and all error cases. \u2705",
